---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for RexBunny Services."
>
  <section class="pt-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="mb-8 text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="prose text-sm text-gray-600">
        <p>Last updated: 2026</p>
        <h2 class="text-gray-900">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you use our free audit tool, we collect your email address and website URL. This information is used to generate your audit report and send follow-up communications.</p>
        <h2 class="text-gray-900">How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To generate and deliver your AI Visibility & SEO audit report</li>
          <li>To send follow-up strategies and relevant case studies</li>
          <li>To improve our audit tool and services</li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="text-gray-900">Data Storage</h2>
        <p>Your data is stored securely in our self-hosted PocketBase database. We do not share your data with third parties except as necessary to deliver the audit service (e.g., n8n workflow execution).</p>
        <h2 class="text-gray-900">Email Communications</h2>
        <p>You can unsubscribe from our email campaigns at any time using the link provided in every email. We use Listmonk, our self-hosted email platform, to manage communications.</p>
        <h2 class="text-gray-900">Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related inquiries, email <a href="mailto:help@rexbunnyservices.online" class="text-brand-600">help@rexbunnyservices.online</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
